TEMP extraction paths with GUID folders observed.
WiX Burn bootstrapper parameters detected:
-BURN.ELEVATED
-BURN.CLEAN.ROOM
Parent-child process chain matched Dell updater workflow.
Verdict

Likely benign Dell SupportAssist update activity.

